    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Psalm 50"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "God, the Judge of the Righteous and the Wicked."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Psalm of Asaph."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Mighty One, God, the Lord, has spoken",
          "And summoned the earth, from the rising of the sun to its setting."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Out of Zion, the perfection of beauty,",
          "God has shone."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "May our God come and not keep silent;",
          "Fire devours before Him,",
          "And a storm is violently raging around Him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He summons the heavens above,",
          "And the earth, to judge His people:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Gather My godly ones to Me,",
          "Those who have made a covenant with Me by sacrifice.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And the heavens declare His righteousness,",
          "For God Himself is judge."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶“Hear, My people, and I will speak;",
          "Israel, I will testify against you;",
          "I am God, your God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I do not rebuke you for your sacrifices,",
          "And your burnt offerings are continually before Me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I will not take a bull from your house,",
          "Nor male goats from your folds."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“For every animal of the forest is Mine,",
          "The cattle on a thousand hills."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I know every bird of the mountains,",
          "And everything that moves in the field is Mine."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“If I were hungry I would not tell you,",
          "For the world is Mine, and everything it contains."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Shall I eat the flesh of bulls",
          "Or drink the blood of male goats?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Offer God a sacrifice of thanksgiving",
          "And pay your vows to the Most High;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Call upon Me on the day of trouble;",
          "I will rescue you, and you will honor Me.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶But to the wicked God says,",
          "“What right do you have to tell of My statutes",
          "And to take My covenant in your mouth?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“For you yourself hate discipline,",
          "And you throw My words behind you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“When you see a thief, you become friends with him,",
          "And you associate with adulterers."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“You let your mouth loose in evil,",
          "And your tongue harnesses deceit."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“You sit and speak against your brother;",
          "You slander your own mother’s son."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“These things you have done and I kept silent;",
          "You thought that I was just like you;",
          "I will rebuke you and present the case before your eyes."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶“Now consider this, you who forget God,",
          "Or I will tear you in pieces, and there will be no one to save you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“He who offers a sacrifice of thanksgiving honors Me;",
          "And to him who sets his way properly",
          "I will show the salvation of God.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
